WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.796 --> 00:00:05.331
THE STRONGEST SECRETARIES OF

00:00:05.332 --> 00:00:06.532
STATE WE'VE HAD.

00:00:06.533 --> 00:00:08.501
ACCORDING TO NEWS REPORTS,

00:00:08.502 --> 00:00:10.837
PASTOR BRONSON IS THAT 19TH

00:00:10.838 --> 00:00:12.338
PRISONER -- PERHAPS HOSTAGES THE

00:00:12.339 --> 00:00:14.340
RIGHT WORD FREED BY THE TRUMP

00:00:14.341 --> 00:00:15.107
ADMINISTRATION.

00:00:15.108 --> 00:00:16.709
HERE HE IS PRAYING WITH THE

00:00:16.710 --> 00:00:17.677
PRESIDENT AT THE WHITE HOUSE

00:00:17.678 --> 00:00:21.914
OVER THE WEEKEND -- TAKE A LOOK.

00:00:21.915 --> 00:00:25.284
&gt;&gt; I ASK THAT YOU POUR OUT YOUR

00:00:25.285 --> 00:00:26.018
HOLY SPIRIT ON PRESIDENT TRUMP,

00:00:26.019 --> 00:00:28.888
YOU GIVE HIM SUPERNATURAL WISDOM

00:00:28.889 --> 00:00:30.056
TO ACCOMPLISH ALL THE PLANS YOU

00:00:30.057 --> 00:00:34.260
HAVE FOR THIS COUNTRY.

00:00:34.261 --> 00:00:38.498
I ASK THAT YOU GET SOME WISDOM

00:00:38.499 --> 00:00:39.966
NOT

00:00:39.967 --> 00:00:41.934
TO LEAD THIS COUNTRY INTO

00:00:41.935 --> 00:00:42.368
RIGHTEOUSNESS.

00:00:42.369 --> 00:00:43.870
&gt;&gt; Sean: JOINING US NOW IS

00:00:43.871 --> 00:00:45.438
PASTOR BRONSON HIMSELF.

00:00:45.439 --> 00:00:49.909
I KNOW HOW MANY WORKED ON YOUR

00:00:49.910 --> 00:00:51.511
BEHALF -- YOU ARE HELD FOR 1818

00:00:51.512 --> 00:00:54.747
MONTHS AND HAD NO REASON, NO

00:00:54.748 --> 00:00:55.481
UNDERSTANDING OF WHY AND WERE

00:00:55.482 --> 00:00:58.150
HELD IN A CELL DESIGNED FOR 8

00:00:58.151 --> 00:01:00.653
AND THERE WERE 21 PEOPLE.

00:01:00.654 --> 00:01:02.522
CORRECT?

00:01:02.523 --> 00:01:05.291
&gt;&gt; PART OF THAT GAME IT WAS VERY

00:01:05.292 --> 00:01:09.262
CROWDED IN THAT CELL.

00:01:09.263 --> 00:01:13.699
IT WAS A VERY DIFFICULT TIME.

00:01:13.700 --> 00:01:15.568
I WAS SURPRISED BECAUSE I HAD

00:01:15.569 --> 00:01:16.936
NEVER CONSIDERED PRISON AS A

00:01:16.937 --> 00:01:18.704
POSSIBILITY AND THE COSTS FOR

00:01:18.705 --> 00:01:19.105
THAT.

00:01:19.106 --> 00:01:21.908
&gt;&gt; Sean: HOW WERE YOU TREATED?

00:01:21.909 --> 00:01:22.909
&gt;&gt; I WAS TREATED WELL BY THE

00:01:22.910 --> 00:01:25.945
PRISONERS I WAS WITH.

00:01:25.946 --> 00:01:27.680
&gt;&gt; Sean: THEY WERE NOT OF YOUR

00:01:27.681 --> 00:01:27.980
FAITH.

00:01:27.981 --> 00:01:29.415
&gt;&gt; THEY WEREN'T AND THAT WAS ONE

00:01:29.416 --> 00:01:32.518
OF THE DIFFICULT THINGS.

00:01:32.519 --> 00:01:35.521
I WAS ISOLATED BY CULTURE AND BY

00:01:35.522 --> 00:01:36.722
LANGUAGE BUT ESPECIALLY BY

00:01:36.723 --> 00:01:37.089
RELIGION.

00:01:37.090 --> 00:01:37.890
IT WAS VERY DIFFICULT TO BE THE

00:01:37.891 --> 00:01:40.693
ONLY CHRISTIAN AMONG THEM.

00:01:40.694 --> 00:01:41.360
&gt;&gt; Sean: WHEN YOU FOUND OUT

00:01:41.361 --> 00:01:42.795
WHAT YOU WERE BEING HELD FOR

00:01:42.796 --> 00:01:43.829
WHICH WAS YOUR FAITH, WHAT DID

00:01:43.830 --> 00:01:47.533
YOU THINK?

00:01:47.534 --> 00:01:48.834
&gt;&gt; WHAT WAS SURPRISING IS THAT

00:01:48.835 --> 00:01:51.938
THEY TOLD ME I WAS BEING HELD

00:01:51.939 --> 00:01:52.805
FOR TERRORISM AND FOR TRYING TO

00:01:52.806 --> 00:01:54.907
OVERTHROW THE GOVERNMENT.

00:01:54.908 --> 00:01:57.009
THE TRUTH IS IF WE HAD BEEN

00:01:57.010 --> 00:02:01.113
PREACHING JESUS CHRIST -- THAT'S

00:02:01.114 --> 00:02:03.149
WHY WE WERE IN TURKEY -- IS TO

00:02:03.150 --> 00:02:05.117
SHARE THE GOSPEL OF JESUS CHRIST

00:02:05.118 --> 00:02:05.518
WITH TURKS.

00:02:05.519 --> 00:02:07.153
WE DID THAT OPENLY AND NEVER HAD

00:02:07.154 --> 00:02:07.720
A PROBLEM.

00:02:07.721 --> 00:02:09.055
IT WAS VERY SHOCKING TO BE

00:02:09.056 --> 00:02:13.292
ACCUSED OF TERRORISM.

00:02:13.293 --> 00:02:15.428
&gt;&gt; AND IT CAME DOWN TO YOUR

00:02:15.429 --> 00:02:17.496
CHRISTIAN FAITH IN MANY WAYS.

00:02:17.497 --> 00:02:18.831
I THOUGHT YOUR PRAYER WAS

00:02:18.832 --> 00:02:19.532
EXTRAORDINARILY TOUCHING WITH

00:02:19.533 --> 00:02:20.666
THE PRESIDENT.

00:02:20.667 --> 00:02:23.302
WHAT WAS YOUR WORST MOMENT?

00:02:23.303 --> 00:02:25.705
I CAN IMAGINE WHEN YOU LOSE YOUR

00:02:25.706 --> 00:02:26.372
FREEDOM YOU LOSE EVERYTHING

00:02:26.373 --> 00:02:29.709
ESPECIALLY IN A FOREIGN COUNTRY,

00:02:29.710 --> 00:02:31.777
NOT KNOWING WHY YOU'RE BEING

00:02:31.778 --> 00:02:33.512
HELD.

00:02:33.513 --> 00:02:34.914
NOT HAVING ANYONE TO SHARE YOUR

00:02:34.915 --> 00:02:36.115
FAITH, YOUR VALUES WITH YOU,

00:02:36.116 --> 00:02:40.519
WHAT WAS YOUR LOWEST MOMENT?

00:02:40.520 --> 00:02:42.588
&gt;&gt; WHEN I WAS ARRESTED AND IT

00:02:42.589 --> 00:02:44.657
KEPT GOING ON AND ON, IT SEEMED

00:02:44.658 --> 00:02:47.560
THAT THERE WAS NO WAY OUT.

00:02:47.561 --> 00:02:51.330
I LOST A LOT OF HOPE.

00:02:51.331 --> 00:02:53.599
I BEGAN TO SEE THERE WAS VALUE

00:02:53.600 --> 00:02:54.767
IN MY SUFFERING ESPECIALLY AS

00:02:54.768 --> 00:02:55.735
TIME WENT ON.

00:02:55.736 --> 00:02:57.436
I SAW THAT MANY PEOPLE AROUND

00:02:57.437 --> 00:02:58.437
THE WORLD BEGAN PRAYING FOR ME

00:02:58.438 --> 00:03:03.009
AND I BEGAN TO SEE --

00:03:03.010 --> 00:03:05.211
&gt;&gt; Sean: HOW DID YOU HEAR

00:03:05.212 --> 00:03:05.711
ABOUT THAT?

00:03:05.712 --> 00:03:07.713
&gt;&gt; MY WIFE, SHE WAS THE ONLY

00:03:07.714 --> 00:03:08.914
CONTACT I HAD WITH THE OUTSIDE

00:03:08.915 --> 00:03:09.215
WORLD.

00:03:09.216 --> 00:03:11.417
SHE COULD VISIT ME FOR ABOUT

00:03:11.418 --> 00:03:14.053
HALF AN HOUR EVERY WEEK SPEAKING

00:03:14.054 --> 00:03:15.688
ON THE PHONE AND SHE WOULD BRING

00:03:15.689 --> 00:03:16.656
ENCOURAGEMENT TO ME AND TELL ME

00:03:16.657 --> 00:03:20.292
THAT PEOPLE WERE PRAYING FOR ME.

00:03:20.293 --> 00:03:21.694
AS I LEARNED THAT, I BEGAN TO

00:03:21.695 --> 00:03:23.095
SEE THAT GOD WAS INVOLVED IN US

00:03:23.096 --> 00:03:23.929
AND HE WAS GOING TO DO SOMETHING

00:03:23.930 --> 00:03:26.565
WITH MY SUFFERING.

00:03:26.566 --> 00:03:30.369
&gt;&gt; Sean: WHY DID YOU SAY IT

00:03:30.370 --> 00:03:32.038
AND THIS MORNING THAT I WAS ONE

00:03:32.039 --> 00:03:33.706
OF THE MOST HATED MAN IN TURKEY?

00:03:33.707 --> 00:03:34.807
&gt;&gt; I WAS ACCUSED OF TRYING TO

00:03:34.808 --> 00:03:38.511
OVERTHROW THE GOVERNMENT, OF

00:03:38.512 --> 00:03:41.247
BEING ALIGNED WITH THE TERRORIST

00:03:41.248 --> 00:03:42.481
MOVEMENT, ALSO BEING PART OF THE

00:03:42.482 --> 00:03:46.519
PKK WHICH IS A GUERRILLA TERROR

00:03:46.520 --> 00:03:48.287
MOVEMENT.

00:03:48.288 --> 00:03:50.356
I WAS PLANED FOR ECONOMIC

00:03:50.357 --> 00:03:50.923
PROBLEMS TURKEY HAD.

00:03:50.924 --> 00:03:52.291
IF THERE ARE PROBABLY AREN'T TOO

00:03:52.292 --> 00:03:54.694
MANY PEOPLE WHO LIKE ME RIGHT

00:03:54.695 --> 00:03:55.027
NOW.

00:03:55.028 --> 00:03:56.095
&gt;&gt; Sean: LET'S TALK ABOUT THE

00:03:56.096 --> 00:03:57.329
MOMENT THAT TOUCHED A LOT OF

00:03:57.330 --> 00:04:00.499
PEOPLE, YOU'RE A MAN OF GREAT

00:04:00.500 --> 00:04:02.034
FAITH AND OBVIOUSLY A STRONG

00:04:02.035 --> 00:04:03.235
CHRISTIAN AND YOU PRAYED FOR THE

00:04:03.236 --> 00:04:03.936
PRESIDENT -- LET'S TALK ABOUT

00:04:03.937 --> 00:04:06.672
THAT MOMENT.

00:04:06.673 --> 00:04:09.208
&gt;&gt; IT'S SOMETHING WE HAD HOPED

00:04:09.209 --> 00:04:12.111
TO BE ABLE TO DO.

00:04:12.112 --> 00:04:14.113
MY WIFE FOR AT SOME TIME WANTED

00:04:14.114 --> 00:04:15.715
TO PRAY SOME VERSES OVER HIM

00:04:15.716 --> 00:04:17.416
FROM ISAIAH, JUST ASKING FOR THE

00:04:17.417 --> 00:04:20.286
SPIRIT OF GOD TO COME UPON HIM.

00:04:20.287 --> 00:04:22.388
BEFORE WE WENT TO MEET HIM, WE

00:04:22.389 --> 00:04:23.322
LEARNED WE WOULD BE ABLE TO

00:04:23.323 --> 00:04:26.292
VISIT IN THE WHITE HOUSE, WE ASK

00:04:26.293 --> 00:04:27.593
GOD TO GIVE A SET OPPORTUNITY TO

00:04:27.594 --> 00:04:29.695
PRAY FOR THE PRESIDENT.

00:04:29.696 --> 00:04:30.896
IT'S A GREAT PRIVILEGE I THINK

00:04:30.897 --> 00:04:33.399
MANY PASTORS WOULD LOVE TO DO I

00:04:33.400 --> 00:04:33.666
IT.

00:04:33.667 --> 00:04:36.302
OUR PRESIDENT NEEDS PRAYER.

00:04:36.303 --> 00:04:38.304
&gt;&gt; Sean: WE ARE GLAD YOU'RE

00:04:38.305 --> 00:04:39.872
HOME, IT WAS A VERY TOUCHING

00:04:39.873 --> 00:04:40.206
MOMENT.

00:04:40.207 --> 00:04:42.942
I THINK ALL OF US COULD USE MORE

00:04:42.943 --> 00:04:46.212
GOD IN OUR LIVES AND I THINK YOU

00:04:46.213 --> 00:04:47.480
IMPACT A LOT OF PEOPLE, WELCOME

00:04:47.481 --> 00:04:50.149
HOME, WERE GLAD TO HAVE YOU BAC

00:04:50.150 --> 00:04:50.683
BACK.

00:04:50.684 --> 00:04:52.953
&gt;&gt; I WANT TO THANK YOU FOR

